 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon Translate API (2017-07-01). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. ImportTerminology reads the inline CSV or TSV file (UNI directionality only; TMX and MULTI are refused): the header row names the source and target languages and each further row is one term. Only the derived properties are stored, so GetTerminology returns no TerminologyDataLocation, and re-importing replaces only the supplied properties. Terms are never applied to a translation. Parallel data stays CREATING: the ParallelDataConfig S3 file is never read, so no record is imported and no language codes or counts are reported; UpdateParallelData returns UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. TranslateText, TranslateDocument, batch translation jobs and ListLanguages return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501.",
  "title": "Amazon Translate (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2017-07-01"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
